            "body": "hi this update implements the fix at the tag jump consumption layer for #41313\ni changed expand tag fname to keep the literal name when the expanded result does not exist\ni added a real tag jump regression test with a dollar filename and kept uri examples and code syntax intact\nexisting behavior is preserved when expansion resolves and no local build was available so ci verification is still needed\nthanks\nhttps://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/41313\n",
